- **Why validate**: This is a single independent synthesis. Both objectives were measured. The membrane quality was excellent. The result is Pareto-competitive (modulus comparable to the 17.5 wt% cluster, pore fraction 0.31). Per policy, a single-run Pareto candidate with no independent repeat must be validated before being treated as confirmed.
- **Expected benefit**: Confirming reproducibility at 18 wt% / 12°C bath / N2 would establish a reliable operating point. If reproduced, it extends the confirmed Pareto front into the 18 wt% / cooler-bath region. If the modulus or pore fraction differs substantially, it informs us about variability in this region.
